error[E0235]: main.kara:11:11: cannot pass once-callable closure where 'Fn()' is expected; the slot promises repeatable invocation but the closure has type 'OnceFn()' (closure becomes once-callable because it consumes captured binding 'ticket'); help: invoke the closure locally instead of routing it through this slot, or change the slot type to `OnceFn(...)` if you control its declaration. Cloning the capture is not a caller-side fix here: it additionally needs the clone inside the body, `Clone` on the captured type, and an `allocates` effect on the slot — so it requires editing the declaration too, where `OnceFn(...)` is the smaller change
